REGLA DE VARIACIÓN
=========================================================================

variation:

current - previous

=========================================================================

REGLA DE VARIACIÓN PORCENTUAL
=========================================================================

Si:

previous != 0

variationPercentage:

((current - previous) / previous) * 100

Si:

previous == 0

debe utilizarse:

0

No dividir por cero.

=========================================================================

IMPORTANTE
=========================================================================

Cuando previous == 0 y current != 0:

variationPercentage = 0

No utilizar:

Infinity

NaN

null

No lanzar:

ArithmeticException

